# DEP-12. Upstream and maintainer are the same person here, so these all point
# at the one repository -- which is the honest answer rather than a placeholder:
# there is no separate upstream to name.
#
# Bug-Database and Repository are the two that matter; without them lintian
# reports upstream-metadata-missing-bug-tracking and
# upstream-metadata-missing-repository, which is what mentors' QA surfaced.
Bug-Database: https://github.com/masroorahmd/fortune-hadith/issues
Bug-Submit: https://github.com/masroorahmd/fortune-hadith/issues/new
Repository: https://github.com/masroorahmd/fortune-hadith.git
Repository-Browse: https://github.com/masroorahmd/fortune-hadith
